      "created_at": "2016-03-24T03:36:53.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Played a Villains game last night: Prime Wardens Tempest, Alt-Sentinels, and Captain Cosmic vs. Plague Rat, Hammer and Anvil, and Biomancer in Magmaria.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>All the villain decks were new to us. My playtesting on Villains was scant. We eventually managed to take down Hammer and Anvil, but did just a small amount of damage to Plague Rat and effectively none to Biomancer before losing.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Bastion. Oi this card!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I gave Durasteel Chains to the Magmarians in order to have them beat on Anvil. THAT was a hard choice.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:05.231Z",
