      "created_at": "2016-03-26T11:10:30.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Oh, it's a Hammer-and-Anvil card? Okay, that's one reason I hadn't heard of it, then :D (the implication in this thread had been that it was a Biomancer card). I've only fought them once and that was last Sunday at the London meet, and I don't know if it came up because I wasn't handling their deck. Sounds like a bit of a pain in the arse, though. That one in Miss Information's deck that makes villain targets immune to damage is a pain too, though at least that's an Ongoing that can be dealt with the normal way (assuming you have someone who can do that ;))...</p>",
